  "contentHtml": "<p><strong>2026伊娃东方舞暑期SWOD技巧超魔班·圆满收官</strong></p><p><strong>20天沉浸式蜕变，用汗水浇灌热爱！</strong></p><p>授课教师：伊娃<br>助教老师：Elina七七、Monica欧海艳</p><p>7月2日-7月21日，2026伊娃东方舞暑期SWOD技巧超魔班在掌声与不舍中圆满落幕！</p><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-001-c5fb64bdeac0.jpg\" alt=\"2026暑期SWOD技巧超魔班结业合影\"><p>20天，每天8小时的高强度训练，从基础技巧的打磨到舞台表现力的突破，每一位学员都在汗水中突破自我，在坚持中见证成长。那些反复练习的旋转、精益求精的律动、彼此鼓励的眼神，都成为这个夏天最珍贵的记忆。</p><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-002-a8f06e9942a6.jpg\" alt=\"2026暑期SWOD技巧超魔班学员合影\"><p>感谢每一位全力以赴的舞者，是你们让“超魔班”的意义不止于技巧，更在于对东方舞的热爱与执着；感谢导师团队的倾囊相授，用专业与耐心为学员点亮前行的路；也感谢所有幕后工作人员的默默付出，让这场舞蹈之旅温暖而有力。结课不是终点，而是新的起点。愿大家带着这份收获与热爱，继续在东方舞的世界里绽放光芒，期待下一次相聚，我们依旧以舞为伴，步履不停！</p><h2>获得全勤通过的魔女们</h2><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-003-a8503ed207c0.jpg\" alt=\"全勤学员结业证书合影1\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-004-ab839e1d01ff.jpg\" alt=\"全勤学员结业证书合影2\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-005-af4b6e49e630.jpg\" alt=\"全勤学员结业证书合影3\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-006-35fcb62882c6.jpg\" alt=\"全勤学员结业证书合影4\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-007-6249457e5fff.jpg\" alt=\"全勤学员结业证书合影5\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-008-cca96db05c08.jpg\" alt=\"全勤学员结业证书合影6\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-009-4c90871ae88b.jpg\" alt=\"全勤学员结业证书合影7\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-010-9ce7daa16c85.jpg\" alt=\"全勤学员结业证书合影8\"><h2>听魔女们在说</h2><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-011-0f0385365165.jpg\" alt=\"学员结业感言1\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-012-9eb4f320d15b.jpg\" alt=\"学员结业感言2\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-013-dfd2a5152f44.jpg\" alt=\"学员结业感言3\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-014-be6a4d90b3a5.jpg\" alt=\"学员结业感言4\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-015-25911ba9e33c.jpg\" alt=\"学员结业感言5\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-016-81064b56349c.jpg\" alt=\"学员结业感言6\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-017-722724a4a57f.jpg\" alt=\"学员结业感言7\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-018-0767b2438234.jpg\" alt=\"学员结业感言8\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-019-6a213e801372.jpg\" alt=\"学员结业感言9\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-020-a2ce8e0dbcfc.jpg\" alt=\"学员结业感言10\"><h2>课堂视频（花絮）</h2><blockquote>原文包含9段微信视频号课堂花絮。为保证播放稳定性与尊重微信视频号发布机制，请点击文末“查看公众号原文”观看完整视频。</blockquote><h2>课堂期间团体大合影</h2><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-021-b9feb3d297c8.jpg\" alt=\"技巧超魔班课堂团体合影1\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-022-e634658a9edd.jpg\" alt=\"技巧超魔班课堂团体合影2\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-023-a36d7759f4ec.jpg\" alt=\"技巧超魔班课堂团体合影3\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-024-2502e0937bf0.jpg\" alt=\"技巧超魔班结业大合影\"><img src=\"/images/reports/2026-swod-technique-bootcamp-graduation/image-025-af2de3382a12.jpg\" alt=\"SWOD标志\"><p><strong>课程咨询：</strong>yiwa2025、yiwa2028、yiwa2031、yiwa2029（官方微信）</p><p><strong>SWOD系统推荐教材：</strong><br>中南大学出版社《东方舞技巧大全》</p>",
